Z||000005||Songman||03-20-2001||11:23 PM||||That is a nice looking kit.. but I have to wonder about it for a few reasons.<P>One is that obviously very few people have ever seen one.<P>Two is that the address listed on this page is in a residential section of Racine, WI.<P>Three is the 'student' e-mail address.<P>Four is that anyone that sends $10 to that address knowing nothing more than is listed on that page is crazy!<P>But it is kinda cool that the phone number and street address is the same. 5339<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
Z||000006||WisconsinGT||03-21-2001||04:17 AM||||I know a guy who did that rebody on an 88 Formula. It is red and he has a 3800 supercharger in it. It has to be one of the best looking kits around. I followed him down to Fierorama last year. He told me the guy that did the kits had to go out of business due to a divorce. Maybe someone started it up again. Good luck!||||reg||1
